  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちか",
    "text": "「ヘルプマン！　こっちこっち、早くきて！　そうそう、その階段からあがってきて！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 49,
    "dress": "old-snow",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-snow_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 486
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちか",
    "text": "「わたしというお姫さまが、王子さまがくるのを待ってますよぉ♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 49,
    "dress": "old-snow",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-snow_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 486
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちか",
    "text": "「よしよし、きましたね！　説明は後！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 49,
    "dress": "old-snow",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-snow_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 486
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちか",
    "text": "「とりあえず座って、手足を前にのばして！　そして、わたしを抱きしめて～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちか",
    "text": "「行きますよぉ、出発進行っ☆」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちか",
    "text": "「にょ～ん、すっごいスリル！　『滑り台』なんて子供のころ以来ですよぉ♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちか",
    "text": "「無駄に回廊つくったりギミック仕込んだおかげで、エンターテイメントとして完成されています！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちか",
    "text": "「我ながら、傑作……☆」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 49,
    "dress": "old-snow",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-snow_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 486
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちか",
    "text": "「氷でできた滑り台だから、お尻が濡れてちょっぴり冷えちゃいそうですが。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 49,
    "dress": "old-snow",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-snow_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 486
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちか",
    "text": "「ヘルプマンを座布団にすることで、この問題点も解消……♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちか",
    "text": "「あったかくて心地いいうえ、楽しくって最高！　さぁ行きましょうヘルプマン、無限の彼方へ……☆」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちか",
    "text": "「にょ～ん♪　にゅ～ん♪　にょんにょにょにゅ～ん♪」"
  },
